expecting a synchronous client interface, adopting amqtt would require introducing an asyncio event loop / thread-based bridging layer throughout the call 
chain — this is an architectural change beyond what wrapper functions can safely and correctly encapsulate for all edge cases (e.g., error propagation, 
timeouts, concurrent publishes).

